### Return Type

The external validator must return an `ExternalValidatorResult` with the following structure:

```
export type ExternalValidatorResult =
  | {
      type: "external";
      name: string;
      valid: true;
    }
  | {
      type: "external";
      name: string;
      valid: false;
      details: {
        message?: string;
      };
    };
```

- `type`: Always set to `"external"`

